[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2041.43, "timestamp": "00:34:01", "text": "狂野的形态。嗯，你也可以……嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2043.11, "timestamp": "00:34:03", "text": "也就是说，基本上你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2044.389, "timestamp": "00:34:04", "text": "变形。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2047.83, "timestamp": "00:34:07", "text": "哦。哦，不错。好的。那也可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2048.47, "timestamp": "00:34:08", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2050.069, "timestamp": "00:34:10", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2050.629, "timestamp": "00:34:10", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2052.869, "timestamp": "00:34:12", "text": "是的。如果你喜欢的话，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2055.19, "timestamp": "00:34:15", "text": "那只是其中一种选择。另一种选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2057.51, "timestamp": "00:34:17", "text": "大概就像……嗯，我想是和尚和一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2059.109, "timestamp": "00:34:19", "text": "星体自我。让我查一下这是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2061.349, "timestamp": "00:34:21", "text": "是吗？开始了。是的，在星界之中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2064.55, "timestamp": "00:34:24", "text": "自己。呃，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2067.27, "timestamp": "00:34:27", "text": "呃，你叫什么来着？嗯，你有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2069.99, "timestamp": "00:34:29", "text": "站立。但是，呃，有点像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2071.43, "timestamp": "00:34:31", "text": "某种星体投射之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2074.069, "timestamp": "00:34:34", "text": "诸如此类的事情。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2074.629, "timestamp": "00:34:34", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2077.109, "timestamp": "00:34:37", "text": "等等，那是给德鲁伊用的吗？哦，和尚。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2078.629, "timestamp": "00:34:38", "text": "哦，不。这是给僧侣的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2081.109, "timestamp": "00:34:41", "text": "不同的。嗯，是的，我觉得那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2083.27, "timestamp": "00:34:43", "text": "其中两人喜欢某种东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2084.95, "timestamp": "00:34:44", "text": "星星出现了。我想知道还有什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2086.31, "timestamp": "00:34:46", "text": "或许可行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2092.389, "timestamp": "00:34:52", "text": "我觉得是那两个人。是的，我觉得那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2095.26, "timestamp": "00:34:55", "text": "其中两个是最接近的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2097.91, "timestamp": "00:34:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]